# BuildKit reads <dockerfile>.dockerignore for this image, so the root
# allow-list (which exists to keep the public Python image small) does not
# apply. This one keeps the context to what the Rust core compiles.
*
!engine/core/
!engine/core/**
!src/vogt/storage/sqlite/migrations/
!src/vogt/storage/sqlite/migrations/**
!vogt-lifecycle.sh
!engine/Cargo.toml
